Package: ThotAndAmun
Version: 3.2026.10
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openjdk-25-jre
Maintainer: Tobias Hilbricht <hilbricht@linopus.de>
Description: Thot+Amun is a tool to take notes and to edit, collect, tag, find, annotate, reference, and connect your notes to document outlines. Thot+Amun exports to HTML and LaTeX and in presence of Pandoc to DOCX and ODT.
